---

<Layout>
	<section>
		<article class="mb-5">
			<h1>TED® Hair Restoration</h1>
			<p class="text-xl bg-[#EEE8E0] px-2">Pre-Treatment Instructions</p>
		</article>
		<article>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>About TED®</h2>
				<p>TED® is a non-invasive ultrasound-based treatment that delivers a proprietary hair growth serum into the scalp without needles.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Who May Benefit?</h2>
				<p>	• Male pattern hair loss <br>
					• Female pattern hair loss <br>
					• Hair thinning <br>
					• Excessive hair shedding <br>
					• Patients seeking a needle-free option <br>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Before Your Appointment</h2>
				<p>	• Arrive with clean hair and scalp. <br>
					• Do not use styling products or oils. <br>
					• Remove hearing aids and jewelry. <br>
					• Remove makeup or moisturizer from the treatment area. <br>
					• Stay well hydrated. <br>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Contraindications &amp; Important Safety Information</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Implanted Medical Devices</h2>
				<p>	● Pacemaker <br>
					● Implanted cardioverter-defibrillator (ICD) <br>
					● Deep brain stimulator <br>
					● Other implanted electronic medical devices <br>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Metal Implants &amp; Orthopedic Hardware</h2>
				<p>	● Total hip replacement containing methylmethacrylate or high-density polyethylene <br>
					● Bone ingrowth arthroplasties <br>
					● Metal implants near the treatment area <br>
					● Aneurysm clips <br>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Areas That Should Not Be Treated</h2>
				<p>TED® should not be used:</p>
				<p>	● Over the eyes <br>
					● Near the brain <br>
					● Near cervical ganglia <br>
					● Over the spine or laminectomy sites <br>
					● Near reproductive organs <br>
					● Over bone growth centers until skeletal maturity <br>
					● Over a healing fracture <br>
					● Over a pregnant uterus <br>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Medical Conditions</h2>
				<p>Tell your provider if you have:</p>
				<p>	● Cardiac disease <br>
					● Thrombophlebitis <br>
					● History of blood clots <br>
					● Significant vascular disease <br>
					● Poor circulation <br>
					● Recent bleeding or hemorrhage <br>
					● Active infection <br>
					● Active tuberculosis <br>
					● Known malignancy in the treatment area <br>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>NOT A CANDIDATE IF:</h2>
				<p>	● Active scalp infection <br>
					● Open scalp wounds <br>
					● Pregnancy <br>
					● Unable to remove hearing aids <br>
					● Implanted electrical device <br>
					● Unable to remain still during treatment <br>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="separation">
				<h2>Questions?</h2>
				<p>kiwiMEDSPA</p>
				<p>Medical Weight Loss &amp; Aesthetics</p>
				<p>Dr. Sergio Angel, MD</p>
				<p>Dr. Allie Angel, MD</p>
				<p>470-310-8155</p>
			</div>
		
		</article>
	</section>
</Layout>
